---
import Section from "@/components/section/Section.astro";
---

<Section aria-label='Technology' rails='dashed'>
  <article class='relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16'>
    <h2 class='shrink-0'>It's just PostgreSQL.</h2>
    <div class='section-description flex flex-col gap-4'>
      <p>
        At its core, Keynes is a collection of PostgreSQL tables and functions.
        Policies are defined in SQL. You can run it in-process without a
        database via PGLite, host it on our managed cloud service, or embed it
        directly into your own database so that you can enforce policies inside
        transactions and use your own data without a network roundtrip.
      </p>
      <p>
        Private preview. Open-source release planned under Apache 2.0. Go forth
        and build!
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Section>
